This contains the robotics basics
Robotics is the science of making and using robots. Robots are smart machines that can move, do work, and help people
A robot is a machine.It follows a computer program.It can do tasks all by itself.
Robotics applications span manufacturing, healthcare, and agriculture.Manufacturing, healthcare, agriculture, logistics, space exploration, military and defense, construction, underwater exploration, hazardous waste management, entertainment, food preparation, domestic household chores, and education
